# Ignore everything...
*
# ...but still descend into folders to look for markdown
!*/
# ...and keep markdown files
!*.md
# ...and images, so note embeds work
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.gif
!*.webp
!*.svg
# ...and canvases and base dashboards
!*.canvas
!*.base
# ...and this file itself
!.gitignore
# ...and .gitattributes, which the `*` rule above would otherwise swallow
!.gitattributes

# .obsidian is deliberately NOT tracked. master_vault is the only fully
# configured vault; this one ships notes, not a setup to copy.
.obsidian/

# Dropbox sync artifacts
*conflicted copy*
